stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Provisioned: create or clone
    Provisioned --> Preparing: generate credential before export
    Preparing --> Exported: exact VM initiator / generation
    Exported --> Exported: online grow only
    Exported --> Fencing: remove / replace / recover / delete
    Preparing --> Fencing: interrupted or uncertain export
    Fencing --> Fenced: backend kernel barriers complete
    Fenced --> Preparing: new credential generation
    Fenced --> Retired: explicit retirement
    Retired --> [*]: separate authorized destruction
    note right of Fencing
        Timeout or Pod deletion is not completion
        No replacement writer until fence succeeds
    end note
    note right of Retired
        Retired is not destroyed
        Retained data needs a separate owner
    end note
